{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","id":"2b383d54-62e1-4b9f-8b5f-d7c08d619bcf","timestamp":"2026-11-08T05:07:45.875Z","version":"2.1.319","querySource":"repl_main_thread","shapeHash":"5685418bd6f66308fa90ee5dade4a2397602d74a9bb9e15af07b03e1cb0aac0d","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"984be633-b222-4a02-896e-e2942adaa42e","keep":802,"tail":["743c6f1c9aaf24f6914ec26c2cbad993cf211d9a29c38d41be7afaaff7963e5a","69833cf228a456aa91c816b7e573139fe8ea25f1157c2ca91f97712cf6187f73","ab3cf25bff59896eef2fd929e8626ff32dee1f6eec3f76d9fefaf9d35fbc4c61"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",804,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"35dad2b68724aea94ee6c604b9e4a8d31b9ee5b6c2dd2b3e59750289d1acb56d"}
{"parentUuid":"7ca621b8-1778-4a80-a214-2fe3b971e967","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgpt67ABDUbTNRD5TkbeS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three changes are on the landing page, and the build passes. I checked each one in screenshot sequences on the real GPU.\n\n**1. Reversed:** the cell body is on the left, the axon runs right, and the text block is bottom-right and right-aligned. The glow lands on the end of \"labs\". I moved the model credit to the bottom-left so it doesn't clash with the text.\n\n**2. The orange glow is hidden until the pulse reaches the end.** Two fixes:\n- **Leftover trail:** after each run it snapped back and stayed parked at the terminals. Now it's invisible except while travelling.\n- **Later start:** it used to start when the pulse reached the middle of the terminals. Now it waits for the furthest tip of the neuron.\n\nAcross 13 frames, orange appeared on the path only mid-travel, and none lingered between firings.\n\n**3. More centred, with a tilt:**\n- **Neuron:** lower, further left and slightly smaller, so the cell body and dendrites fill the left side.\n- **Tilt:** about 8°, so the axon slopes down to the right with the terminals ending just above and left of the name. It still rolls about its own length, because the roll happens inside the tilted frame.\n- **Text block:** moved in from the right edge, roughly 15% of the screen width on a laptop.\n\nThe tuning values are at the top of `src/components/neuron-viewer.tsx`:\n- `AXIS_Y`: vertical position.\n- `SHIFT_X`: horizontal nudge.\n- `TILT_DEG`: angle.\n- `FILL_W`: size.\n\nThe text position is the `right-[…]` classes on `<main>` in `src/pages/Landing.tsx`.\n\nI also corrected the line I'd added to `docs/STATUS.md` earlier, so it matches this orientation. It still needs committing and pushing with the rest."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1041,"cache_read_input_tokens":874944,"output_tokens":609,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1041,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":609,"cache_read_input_tokens":874944,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1041,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1041},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9e63ef29-2b43-4ba9-ab47-36c1bc4636a0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgpt66p6T57fiGuXoKbFt","requestRef":"2b383d54-62e1-4b9f-8b5f-d7c08d619bcf","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"6adc8796-eb4c-448b-8b55-9e5791c94050","timestamp":"2026-11-08T05:07:52.783Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","sessionId":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"frontend/diagnosis"}
