ert\">{error}</p> : null}\r","-        {!configured ? <p className=\"mt-3 text-xs text-foreground/60\">Add Supabase keys to .env to enable sign-in.</p> : null}\r","-      </main>\r","-    </div>\r","-  )\r","-}\r","+import { useCallback, useRef, useState } from 'react'","+import { Navigate } from 'react-router-dom'","+import { AsciiBackground } from '@/components/background'","+import NeuronViewer from '@/components/neuron-viewer'","+import { AFTER_SIGN_IN, useAuth } from '@/lib/auth'","+","+const reducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches","+","+function GoogleIcon() {","+  return (","+    <svg className=\"size-4 shrink-0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden>","+      <path fill=\"#4285F4\" d=\"M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z\" />","+      <path fill=\"#34A853\" d=\"M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z\" />","+      <path fill=\"#FBBC05\" d=\"M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.07H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.93l2.85-2.22.81-.62z\" />","+      <path fill=\"#EA4335\" d=\"M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.07l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.53 6.16-4.53z\" />","+    </svg>","+  )","+}","+","+const BEAM = '#ffd84d'","+const INK = '#13293d'","+","+/**","+ * Carries a pulse from the axon terminals to the wordmark: a faint guide path,","+ * an amber comet travelling down it, and the name lighting up when it lands.","+ */","+function useSignalToName() {","+  const name = useRef<HTMLHeadingElement>(null)","+  const guide = useRef<SVGPathElement>(null)","+  const comet = useRef<SVGPathElement>(null)","+","+  const fire = useCallback((x: number, y: number) => {","+    const h = name.current","+    const g = guide.current","+    const c = comet.current","+    if (!h || !g || !c) return","+    const r = h.getBoundingClientRect()","+    const tx = r.right - r.width * 0.16 // lands on the top of the last letters","+    const ty = r.top + r.height * 0.12","+    const dy = ty - y","+    const d = `M ${x} ${y} C ${x} ${y + dy * 0.55}, ${tx} ${ty - dy * 0.45}, ${tx} ${ty}`","+    g.setAttribute('d', d)","+    c.setAttribute('d', d)","+    g.style.opacity = '1'","+    const len = c.getTotalLength()","+    const seg = Math.min(180, len * 0.4)","+    c.style.strokeDasharray = `${seg} ${len + seg}`","+    // Visible only while travelling: hidden before it leaves the terminals and after it lands.","+    c.animate(","+      [","+        { strokeDashoffset: seg, opacity: 1 },","+        { strokeDashoffset: -len, opacity: 1 },","+      ],","+      { duration: 1300, easing: 'cubic-bezier(0.45, 0, 0.25, 1)' },","+    ).onfinish = () => {","+      h.animate(","+        [","+          { color: INK, textShadow: `0 0 0 ${BEAM}00` },","+          { color: '#a8820f', textShadow: `0 0 22px ${BEAM}99`, offset: 0.18 },","+          { color: INK, textShadow: `0 0 0 ${BEAM}00` },","+        ],","+        { duration: 1800, easing: 'ease-out' },","+      )","+    }","+  }, [])","+","+  return { name, guide, comet, fire }","+}","+","+export default function Landing() {","+  const { user, configured, signInWithGoogle } = useAuth()","+  const [busy, setBusy] = useState(false)","+  const [error, setError] = useState('')","+  const signal = useSignalToName()","+","+  if (user) return <Navigate to={AFTER_SIGN_IN} replace />","+","+  async function onSignIn() {","+    setBusy(true)","+    setError('')","+    const failed = await signInWithGoogle()","+    if (failed) {","+      setError(failed)","+      setBusy(false)","+    }","+  }","+","+  return (","+    <div className=\"relative h-dvh w-screen overflow-hidden bg-background text-foreground\">","+      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\">","+        <AsciiBackground />","+      </div>","+","+      {/* The neuron lies across the top of the page: soma left, axon running right to its terminals. */}","+      <NeuronViewer","+        reducedMotion={reducedMotion}","+        onTerminals={signal.fire}","+        className=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"","+      />","+","+      {/* From the terminals, the signal carries on down to the name. */}","+      <svg className=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-[5] h-full w-full\" aria-hidden>","+        <defs>","+          <filter id=\"signal-glow\" x=\"-50%\" y=\"-50%\" width=\"200%\" height=\"200%\">","+            <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"4\" result=\"blur\" />","+            <feMerge>","+              <feMergeNode in=\"blur\" />","+              <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\" />","+            </feMerge>","+          </filter>","+        </defs>","+        <path ref={signal.guide} fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeOpacity=\"0.14\" strokeWidth=\"1.25\" strokeDasharray=\"2 6\" style={{ opacity: 0, transition: 'opacity 600ms ease-out' }} />","+        <path ref={signal.comet} fill=\"none\" stroke={BEAM} strokeWidth=\"4\" strokeLinecap=\"round\" filter=\"url(#signal-glow)\" style={{ opacity: 0 }} />","+      </svg>","+","+      <main className=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-[8vw] bottom-0 z-10 flex flex-col items-end pb-12 text-right md:right-[12vw] md:pb-16 lg:right-[15vw] lg:pb-20\">","+        <h1 ref={signal.name} className=\"font-brand text-6xl leading-none tracking-tight md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl\">addo labs</h1>","+        <p className=\"font-serif-display mt-1 text-2xl leading-tight text-foreground/75 italic md:text-3xl lg:text-[2.1rem]\">","+          ALS drug discovery optimization","+        </p>","+        <button","+          type=\"button\"","+          onClick={onSignIn}","+          disabled={!configured || busy}","+          aria-busy={busy}","+          className=\"pointer-events-auto mt-6 flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-foreground py-2.5 pr-5 pl-2.5 text-sm text-background shadow-[0_6px_20px_-8px_rgb(19_41_61/0.6)] transition-[transform,background-color] duration-200 ease-out hover:bg-foreground/90 active:scale-[0.97] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\"","+        >","+          <span className=\"grid size-7 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background\">","+            <GoogleIcon />","+          </span>","+          {busy ? 'Connecting…' : 'Sign in with Google'}","+        </button>","+        {error ? <p className=\"mt-3 text-xs text-foreground/70\" role=\"alert\">{error}</p> : null}","+        {!configured ? <p className=\"mt-3 text-xs text-foreground/60\">Add Supabase keys to .env to enable sign-in.</p> : null}","+      </main>","+    </div>","+  )","+}"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend\\src\\components\\neuron-viewer.tsx","C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend\\src\\pages\\Landing.tsx"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"f3051859-8426-4e11-b24d-4488f9231378","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/jerem/BioHacks-2026/frontend","root":"/c/Users/jerem/BioHacks-2026","branch":"frontend/diagnosis","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"penguinyogurt/BioHacks-2026","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"penguinyogurt/BioHacks-2026","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"penguinyogurt/BioHacks-2026","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/jerem/BioHacks-2026/frontend","platform":"windows"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f29eb15b-56fd-475d-98ae-c3650cb52f3a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"28437234-f1be-440d-9452-c51de1bd38ab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jerem\\BioHacks-2026\\frontend","s